lords_view_help==>Min. level Name [priority for AI]
units_view_help==>The level threshold is responsible for changing the unit's increments, for example, a unit in the Level column is "1 (10)", and in the health column "100 (+10 / +5)" - this means that for each level up to 10 it will receive an increase in 10 health, and for 11, 12, etc. only 5. In the case of complex attacks, units sometimes display 2 accuracy (for example "100% / 100% (+1, 0)"), in this case it is not an increase in the first attack and an increase the second, and the growth of both before the threshold and after the threshold. The incorruptibility of the leaders is responsible for reducing the chance of a thief's actions on the unit led by this hero.
